00:43:28,571 --> 00:43:34,571
Pumpkin pie is a dessert pie with a spiced, pumpkin-based custard filling.

12
00:47:25,714 --> 00:47:31,714
The pumpkin and pumpkin pie are both a symbol of harvest time, and pumpkin
pie is generally eaten during the fall and early winter.

13
00:51:22,857 --> 00:51:28,857
In the United States and Canada it is usually prepared for Thanksgiving,
Christmas, and other occasions when pumpkin is in season.

14
00:55:20,000 --> 00:55:26,000
Pumpkin is in season generally from mid-October through November.

15
00:59:17,142 --> 00:59:23,142
Harvest occurs during October which is just in time for Thanksgiving.

16
01:03:14,285 --> 01:03:20,285
The pie's filling ranges in color from orange to brown and is baked
in a single pie shell, usually without a top crust.

17
01:07:11,428 --> 01:07:17,428
The pie is generally flavored with pumpkin pie spice, a blend that
includes cinnamon, ginger, nutmeg, and cloves or allspice.

18
01:11:08,571 --> 01:11:14,571
The pie is usually prepared with canned pumpkin, but
fresh-cooked pumpkin can be used.

19
